        "description": {
          "text": "Updated labeling to include second interim overall survival analysis for pertuzumab in combination with trastuzumab and docetaxel in HER2-positive metastatic breast cancer",
          "citations": [
            {
              "quote": "This Prior Approval supplemental biologics application provides for updating the package insert to include the results of the second interim analysis of overall survival for the indication for use in combination with trastuzumab and docetaxel for the treatment of patients with HER2-positive metastatic breast cancer who have not received prior anti-HER2 therapy or chemotherapy for metastatic disease.",
              "doc_id": "04af9d53-7e68-59f4-a8d6-4fe197b0665a",
